:::text id=ozi4Fdz25z at=center width=460 height=40 offsetX=-280 offsetY=-136 preset=caption align=center color=#1E40AF
DEFAULT BEHAVIORS
:::

:::text id=B5_94crorT at=center width=460 height=380 offsetX=-280 offsetY=60 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
• **Out-Loud Brainstorming:** Exploring ideas out loud before settling on solutions.
• **Coherence-Driven:** Easily irritated by incoherence; need to sort it out.
• **Topic-Selective Energy:** High energy on Product & Engineering topics.
• **Build & Discover:** Love building and discovering simultaneously.
:::

:::shape id=4Hj6BENBBR at=center width=520 height=480 offsetX=280 offsetY=56 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
