:::text id=-GidwZa8ml at=center width=460 height=40 offsetX=280 offsetY=-136 preset=caption align=center color=#166534
BUGS & SUPPORT STRATEGIES
:::

:::text id=YBuCFGA89N at=center width=460 height=380 offsetX=280 offsetY=60 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=16
• **Lots of Questions:** *Support:* Provide upfront context & relevance.
• **Slow on Low Energy:** *Support:* Give time to recover; state if urgent.
• **Incoherent when Excited:** *Support:* Let sink in; echo back key points.
• **Pushing Hard:** *Support:* Tell me if energy is better spent elsewhere.
:::
